  "worked_solution": "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{8}\u27e85t-2,\\,\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{{t}^{2}}}\u27e9\\,\\text{d}t & =\u27e8{\\int }_{1}^{8}(5t-2)\\,\\text{d}t,\\,{\\int }_{1}^{8}\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{{t}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}t\u27e9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor the first component, we integrate directly:\n\n$$\n\\int (5t-2)\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{5}{2}{t}^{2}-2t.\n$$\n\nFor the second component, we write \n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{{t}^{2}}}=\\frac{1}{3}{t}^{-2/3}\n$$\n\nand integrate:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{3}{t}^{-2/3}\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\frac{{t}^{1/3}}{1/3}={t}^{1/3}.\n$$\n\nThus,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{8}\u27e85t-2,\\,\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{{t}^{2}}}\u27e9\\,\\text{d}t & =\u27e8(\\frac{5}{2}{t}^{2}-2t){|}_{1}^{8},\\,({t}^{1/3}){|}_{1}^{8}\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8(\\frac{5}{2}\\cdot 64-16)-(\\frac{5}{2}\\cdot 1-2),\\,2-1\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8144-\\frac{1}{2},\\,1\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8\\frac{287}{2},\\,1\u27e9 \\\\  & =\u27e8\\frac{287}{2},\\,1\u27e9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
